sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    CS->>CSMS: Disconnect the connection
    Note over CS: Wait the <Configured transaction duration>
    CS->>CSMS: Restore the connection

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status Accepted

    loop For each connector
        alt Configured EVSE.Connector
            CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (eventData[0].trigger = Delta, component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState", actualValue = "Occupied")
            CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
        else Other connectors
            CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (eventData[0].trigger = Delta, component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState", actualValue = "Available")
            CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
        end
    end

    CS->>CSMS: SecurityEventNotificationRequest (type = StartupOfTheDevice OR ResetOrReboot)
    CSMS-->>CS: SecurityEventNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (eventData.trigger = Delta, transactionId = <transactionId from this transaction>, eventNotificationType = HardWiredNotification, severity = 3, actualValue = true, component.name = ElectricalFeed, variable.name = Problem)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (same content as step 7, but eventData.actualValue = false)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = TxResumed, transactionInfo.transactionId = <transactionId>, transactionInfo.chargingState = Charging)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
